OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThere will be the odd light
OL,6,Fshower around North Argyll and the
OL,7,FIsles at first. Otherwise it will be a
OL,8,Fdry with sunny spells by day.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry in the evening with clear
OL,11,Fspells. Clouding over from the
OL,12,Fsouthwest overnight with some
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain and freshening south
OL,14,Fto southeast winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FIt will be cloudy with mostly
OL,17,Fpatchy light rain by day, but the rain
OL,18,Fturning heavier in the evening.
OL,19,FOccasionally strong winds around the
OL,20,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
